	(text "Lanes QSFP_TX_P1..3, QSFP_TX_N0..3, QSFP_RX_P1..3, QSFP_RX_N0..3 and the same names with a QSFP2_ prefix are global nets. A retimer footprint (Broadcom 400G class) is placed and left unstuffed unless the channel simulation misses the eye. Short route, Megtron 8 stripline, backdrill, no nickel on these pairs (EPIG)."
